// The deployed site: the built app served as static files from Cloudflare under its own domain.
//
// There is no Worker script yet, only the files in dist/. The sync API planned in docs/SYNC.md
// becomes the script of this same Worker, so the domain, the deploy step and the name stay as they
// are when it arrives.
//
// A path that matches no file gets a 404 rather than the app's page. The app routes by hash, so it
// never needs a fallback, and the Wahapedia copy under wahapedia/ is checked by fetching a file
// from it: a fallback there would hand the check a page of HTML with a 200 and it would read it as
// a table.
//
// Only the bare domain is served here. www is a redirect rule in the Cloudflare dashboard, with a
// placeholder DNS record for it, because a request answered by a rule never reaches the Worker
// and so never counts against its daily allowance.
{
  "$schema": "node_modules/wrangler/config-schema.json",
  "name": "grimstat",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-09-01",
  "assets": { "directory": "./dist" },
  "routes": [{ "pattern": "grimstat.com", "custom_domain": true }]
}
